# Core principles

- Search for an existing helper before writing a new one.
- No speculative or unused functions, wrappers, or parameters.
- No `print`; use `logging`.
- Prefer files under ~800 lines; split rather than grow god modules.
- Keep diffs minimal; no new dependencies without a stated reason.
